        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e0dc6fc0-a90b-5457-852d-ad66a5e19285",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Carlsberg Group, Baltic Beverages Holding\n- Products: Carlsberg Beer, Tuborg, Kronenbourg, Somersby cider, Baltika, Grimbergen\n- Places: Grimbergen, Belgium, France, Russia\n- People: Jacobsen, Carl\n\nFacts:\n- Carlsberg Group's flagship brand is Carlsberg Beer, which is named after Jacobsen's son Carl.\n- Carlsberg Group also brews Tuborg, Kronenbourg, Somersby cider, Baltika, Grimbergen abbey beers, and more than 500 local beers.\n- Baltika is Russia's best-selling beer.\n- Grimbergen is a brand of Belgian abbey beers.\n- Grimbergen beers were originally made by Norbertine monks in the Belgian town of Grimbergen.\n- Grimbergen is now brewed by two different breweries in Belgium and France.\n- Baltic Beverages Holding is a brewing company owned by Carlsberg Group.",
